        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Don-Jo 1580, 8 Inch Slide Bolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThese 8\" surface mounted door bolts are made of steel and are UL Listed for fire doors. Available in Brushed Chrome, Polished Brass or Oil Rubbed Bronze finishes. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/don-jo-1580-size.jpg?v=1704354584\" width=\"600\" height=\"320\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Don-Jo 1580 slide bolt size\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: \r\nLonger <a href=\"/products/12-inch-slide-bolt-ul-listed-don-jo-1581-626\"><b>12\" Slide Bolt</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Don-Jo 1580  Door Slide Bolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Bolt Length: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Bolt Width: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Bolt Thickness: 1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Bolt Projection: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Max Projection at Knob: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Bolt Throw: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Guide Plate Width: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Strike Length: 2-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Strike Width: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Rim Angle Strike Length: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Rim Angle Strike Width: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Steel</li>\r\n<li>UL Rated</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/1580.pdf?v=1704262429\" target=\"new\"><b>Don-Jo 1580 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged complete with mortise strike plate, rim angle strike plate, new guides, and mounting screws.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually. </i>\r\n</p>",
